{"nodes": [{"id": "vault_adr_0198_playlists_that_follow_a_flow_decision", "label": "ADR 0198: Build playlists along a flow, with the songs to start from placed where they fit", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "vault/adr/0198-playlists-that-follow-a-flow.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The user: the chosen song always became the first song, the songs' sonic semblances were not similar, and a set should follow a flow (energy grows or stays constant). Rejected: greedy with look-ahead (a fixed later song still pulls badly; the beam costs about 8x a greedy pass, still milliseconds); ordering a chosen pool by energy afterwards (the songs picked would not follow the curve); per-slot targets typed in (offered and declined)."}, {"id": "vault_adr_0198_playlists_that_follow_a_flow_flow_points", "label": "Flow points", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "vault/adr/0198-playlists-that-follow-a-flow.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Points 1-10 spread evenly over the set, smooth between them. Presets: Steady, Warm-up, Build to a peak, Peak and down, Peaks and breathers, Cool-down. Dragging a point makes the flow the user's own; No energy target turns it off; the BPM can follow the flow's shape."}, {"id": "vault_adr_0198_playlists_that_follow_a_flow_roles", "label": "Roles of the songs to start from", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "vault/adr/0198-playlists-that-follow-a-flow.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Where it fits (default: the slot whose energy and BPM targets fit it best), Opener, At the peak, Closer. With no targets at all, the seed opens, as before."}, {"id": "vault_adr_0198_playlists_that_follow_a_flow_score_weights", "label": "Score weights", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "vault/adr/0198-playlists-that-follow-a-flow.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One weights table in autoplaylist.ts: BPM fit 2, energy fit 4, key 2.5, rating 3, tags 3, likeness to the songs started from 3 x Sound, likeness to the song before 1.5 x (0.3 + Sound), -4 for the same artist within 3 songs, -1 per step of an energy jump beyond the flow."}, {"id": "vault_adr_0198_playlists_that_follow_a_flow_beam_search", "label": "Beam search", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "vault/adr/0198-playlists-that-follow-a-flow.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Eight partial sets kept; each step looks at the 48 (+ the step) best songs for the slot; each set's best few drawn with Gumbel noise, so the same seed gives the same set. The four relax steps stay."}], "edges": [{"source": "vault_adr_0198_playlists_that_follow_a_flow_decision", "target": "vault_adr_0029_automatic_playlists_decision", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/adr/0198-playlists-that-follow-a-flow.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "vault_adr_0198_playlists_that_follow_a_flow_decision", "target": "vault_adr_0197_a_sound_profile_for_every_song_decision", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/adr/0198-playlists-that-follow-a-flow.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "vault_adr_0198_playlists_that_follow_a_flow_decision", "target": "src_core_library_autoplaylist", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "vault/adr/0198-playlists-that-follow-a-flow.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "vault_adr_0198_playlists_that_follow_a_flow_decision", "target": "tests_autoplaylist_test", "relation": "references", "confidence":